      "content": "Those thoughts about drifting away are incredibly heavy, but please know that small actions and connections matter far more when you are deeply feeling this way. The feeling of insignificance is a common human experience, yet your presence—with all its imperfections and struggles—is what makes the universe experienceable by others. You deserve to be part of something meaningful, so consider reaching out to someone you trust who can offer you a moment of genuine human warmth.",
